{"server":"tw","storyId":"act12d0_level_act12d0_st02","groupId":"act12d0","stageId":"act12d0_st02","title":"休息時間","storyCode":"RI-ST-2","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_st02.txt","sourceHash":"ba106f3ef327b95d4c8c01a0f9d2ac3ad0623363cca8ab32c0f55ee5417ec191","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"特米米的部族裡，駕駛員狄倫與Lancet-2百無聊賴地聊著天。\n瀑布下，博士一行正在休整，刻俄柏卻突然闖入，並向著祖瑪瑪的部族衝去。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"Lancet-2，我有個嚴肅的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"請問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你不會沒電嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，關於這一點請不用擔心，在出發前，可露希爾姐姐為我換上了超長續航的新型電池。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"理論上我可以在一個星期內不用補充任何能源。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"而且飛行器上也還有備用的電池，所以請不用擔心我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道小刻那孩子怎麼樣了，我們回來的路上她忽然竄起來就跑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"確實，刻俄柏小姐現在的狀況讓人有些擔憂呢，不過考慮到她旺盛的生命力，應該不用太過擔心呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"也對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好無聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"飛行器檢修完畢，嘉維爾送過來的病人的病情也穩定了下來，暫時沒有什麼別的事可以做了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"而且和這裡的人語言又不通，早知道就跟博士去看那什麼祭典了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"飛行器是很重要的羅德島財產，必須要好好保護才行呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"說說而已，我是駕駛員，這點我當然是知道的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你就好啦，Lancet-2，無聊的時候可以切休眠模式，我昨天睡了12個小時，現在根本睡不著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，確切地說，對我來說，並沒有“無聊”的概念呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我可以理解迪倫先生你現在的感情，可露希爾姐姐也經常會發出這樣的感慨，以及通常這樣的情況下她就會去做些奇怪的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不是第一次這麼想了，Lancet-2，你和其他小車裡面真的不是裝了個人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"不是呢，我的裡面是精密的電路結構，你要看嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然由於我的性格預設是女性，所以對於向異性展現身體這件事，我可能會做出一些我自己都無法預想的額外行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"就算要看，這種時候我肯定也是想看泳裝啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"泳裝？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，現在可是夏天，大家穿上泳裝玩水還挺正常吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣的話，我來為你播放一段海浪的音訊吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"別啊，這樣不就顯得我更慘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"......難道說，迪倫先生想看我的泳裝嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"才不要啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"是呢，對不起，畢竟我只是機器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，抱歉，我不是那個意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"請不用介意。說起來，迪倫先生見過海嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，算是見過吧，大概是去年夏天，銀灰老爺因為行程有變借用了羅德島的飛行器，當時是我作為駕駛員送他去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"到了地方後我才發現好像是個度假的地方，然後被銀灰老爺邀請體驗了一把VIP的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖嘖，我在那時才知道，原來是貧窮限制了我對有錢人的想像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，我還有那時候的照片呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"迪倫先生嚮往那樣的生活嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？嚮往啊......雖然那幾天確實很爽，不過真要我一直過那樣的生活，我肯定是過不慣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"還是在駕駛艙裡吃泡麵，每天日夜顛倒的生活適合我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣可不行，迪倫先生，我來為你設計一套比較科學健康的作息表吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"那還是免了吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"真遺憾。可露希爾姐姐雖然為我設計了這個功能，但是無論是她還是博士，都從來沒有用到過這個功能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，那兩位確實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，不過，話又說回來，這裡的部族的生活比我想像的其實也好不少，該有的都有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"是呢，雖然這裡比起外界的生活在便利和舒適程度上差了許多，但是也並沒有什麼特別不便的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"根據我的記錄，這兩天，迪倫先生的身體健康水準也有所回升。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪倫","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"真的假的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"是真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是所謂的回歸自然吧？嘿，也是，畢竟說白了，所有人還不都是從這樣的生活過來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，我記得嘉維爾說過，在那邊的雨林中有一座巨大的瀑布，等博士回來後，去那邊玩應該不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"他們說不定已經過去了也說不定呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"博士做事一向公平，我相信他們一定不會拋下我們去玩水的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"是呢，在那之前，就先耐心等待吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡有叫迪倫的人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你會說薩爾貢語？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"會。和一台機器在一起的人，嗯，應該是你沒錯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"叫博士的傢伙讓我給你帶了一封信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？讓我看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......Lancet-2，看來我們有事做了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，遠遠地就聽到水聲了，沒想到這座瀑布有這麼大！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，我沒瞎說吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，這次就原諒嘉維爾了~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，確實是相當壯觀的瀑布啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"特米米好像還沒來的樣子，先在這裡休息一會兒吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"好耶，我的泳裝總算是沒有白穿~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"戰意盎然啊，小姑娘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"意識到語言不通的克瑪爾沒有說話，只是擺出一個架勢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，反正沒事做，就再陪你打幾場好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"煌大姐和那個女孩子打的真激烈呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"真不知道打架有什麼好玩的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"......你在戰鬥的時候可不是你說的這樣哦，宴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈，說的也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"話說，可頌你穿的不是泳裝吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈，被你發現了。這其實是我買的戶外套裝，防水性還不錯，勉強可以算作泳裝啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"你還真是喜歡實用性比較強的東西誒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，雖然不是海邊，不過在瀑布邊玩水也挺有意思的呢！有種回歸自然的感覺，可惜我沒有帶相機了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"是呢，我也是第一次來到這樣的野外，感覺比想像的要有趣多了~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"咦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"我是不是看錯了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"那個難道不是小刻嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac12_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，這座瀑布不錯吧。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"很不錯。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我以前也很喜歡來這裡洗澡。"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"你好像在想事情的樣子啊，博士。"}]},{"label":"一般般。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"口氣不小啊，博士。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"渡過這裡，然後再走一段路，應該就要到祖瑪瑪的部族了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"收到特米米的來信時，我可沒有想到事情會變成這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉，博士，我這幾天一直有一件事比較苦惱，我們也算交情不錯了，我就問問你好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"博——士——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？我正在和博士說話呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"看那邊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"那是......小刻？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"找到啦，是蘑菇海洋！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"洗澡囉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"看起來還沒恢復神智的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"但是她在水裡打滾的樣子好可愛哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，這個傻孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"乾脆讓她就這麼玩一會兒好了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"比起這個，博士，我剛才要和你說的是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得我的尾巴和以前比有沒有變粗？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"粗了。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？是真的嗎？完了完了，這下回去之後要注意飲食了。"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"幹嘛啊，博士，用那種眼神看我，尾巴可是阿達克利斯的命根！"}]},{"label":"沒注意。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，果然不該指望你。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"你不知道，特米米那個尾巴以前可沒這麼粗，唉，我可不想變成那樣的大尾巴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你對祖瑪瑪沒什麼想法嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？想法是什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得那傢伙挺厲害的啊，能搗鼓出那麼大的機器。"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"聊聊尾巴吧。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我就知道你肯定也會感興趣的！"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"你來了啊，特米米。你的事情辦完了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"怎、怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"好可愛的女孩子！嘉維爾，原來你也有這樣的朋友啊，我還以為你認識的都是和你一樣滿腦子肌肉的傢伙呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"你這傢伙很失禮啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"細膩的皮膚，精緻的五官，暗黑系的穿搭也很合身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"暗黑系？很流行嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有吧，不過在一部分人裡還挺受歡迎的哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我是在雜誌上學來的，據說外面的人都是這麼穿的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，看來你對時尚有很深的誤解呢，不過也沒辦法，畢竟是這樣的地方，會有這樣錯誤的觀念也是難免的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"不過沒關係，就由宴姐姐我來傳授給你正確的時尚知識吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾，我就把她帶走了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"誒？誒誒誒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，隨你吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，這下人就到齊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"我去讓小刻清醒一下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"休息結束！小刻要繼續戰鬥了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾，她又要跑了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，大家快把衣服換好了！快追！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"這個方向，好像是祖瑪瑪部族的方向......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下！你換得這麼快的嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"等等我們啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼好換掉的！就這樣出發！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_017_homura","aliases":["煌"]},{"speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","aliases":["刻俄柏","嘉維爾","宴"]},{"speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","aliases":["可頌"]},{"speakerId":"char_285_medic2","aliases":["Lancet-2","迪倫"]},{"speakerId":"char_337_utage","aliases":["宴"]},{"speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","aliases":["特米米"]},{"speakerId":"char_415_flint","aliases":["燧石"]}]}
